      "text": "Thorns also and thistles shall it bring forth, Gen. 3:18 (Moses 4:24). shall be pricks in your eyes, and thorns in your sides, Num. 33:55 (Judg. 2:3). way of the slothful man is as an hedge of thorns, Prov. 15:19. As a thorn goeth up into the hand of a drunkard, Prov. 26:9. it shall devour the briers and thorns, Isa. 9:18 (10:17; 2 Ne. 19:18; 20:17). Break up your fallow ground, and sow not among thorns, Jer. 4:3. sown wheat, but shall reap thorns, Jer. 12:13.",
